{"schema_version":"1.0.0","id":"cik-0001807794","cik":"0001807794","slug":"credo-technology-group-holding-807794","name":"Credo Technology Group Holding Ltd","ticker":"CRDO","exchanges":["Nasdaq"],"sector":"Semiconductors & Related Devices","sic":"3674","country":"Cayman Islands","website":"","listed_years":4.1,"first_annual":"2022-06-08","last_filing":"2026-07-29","annual_only":false,"edgar_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001807794&type=10-K","summary":{"sentences":["Credo Technology Group Holding Ltd files with the SEC under \"Semiconductors & Related Devices\", based in Cayman Islands, and has been publicly reporting for 4 years.","It reported $1.0bn of revenue over the trailing four quarters, up 201.5% against the same quarter a year earlier, at a gross margin of 68.5%.","Listed on Nasdaq, it funds itself from operations ($59.3m of operating cash flow over the year)."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Revenue grew 201.5% year on year (Q4 2025 vs Q4 2024), reaching $407.0m in the quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1807794/000162828026014017/0001628280-26-014017-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-014017"},{"text":"Growth has been positive in 6 of the last 8 year-on-year comparisons, so this is a trend rather than one good quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1807794/000162828026014017/0001628280-26-014017-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-014017"},{"text":"Gross margin of 68.5% means most of each additional sale falls through to cover fixed costs.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1807794/000162828026014017/0001628280-26-014017-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-014017"},{"text":"Gross margin expanded from 63.6% to 68.5% against the same quarter a year earlier - the company is keeping more of what it sells, not buying growth with discounts.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1807794/000162828026014017/0001628280-26-014017-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-014017"},{"text":"Operating cash flow is positive at $59.3m over the trailing year, so the business funds itself and is not dependent on raising money.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1807794/000180779425000021/0001807794-25-000021-index.htm","accession":"0001807794-25-000021"},{"text":"Net cash of $1.4bn against total assets of $2.3bn - no debt overhang forcing decisions.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1807794/000162828026043303/0001628280-26-043303-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-043303"}],"bear":[{"text":"Growth is erratic - a standard deviation of 107.7% across 8 comparisons. Lumpy revenue usually means few customers or long contracts, and both make any single quarter a poor guide.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1807794/000162828026014017/0001628280-26-014017-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-014017"},{"text":"Diluted share count rose 5.2% over the year (Q4 2025 vs Q4 2024). The company can grow while your share of it shrinks, and this is the number most commentary ignores.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1807794/000162828026014017/0001628280-26-014017-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-014017"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"gross_margin_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Gross margin falls below 61.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"gross_margin","comparison":"below","threshold":0.61,"consecutive":2,"current":0.685,"current_display":"68.5%","threshold_display":"61.0%","fired":f